<title>USA: Coleman Co holding co sells $470 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>Coleman Co holding co sells $470 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-part 144a private placement from Coleman Escrow Corp, a holding company of Coleman Co Inc, was priced on Thursday via lead manager, Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc, market sources said.</p>
<p>The bonds are backed by 44.1 million in common stock of Coleman Co owned by Ronald Perlman.</p>
<p>BORROWER COLEMAN ESCROW CORP</p>
<p>AMT $390 MLN (PROCEEDS)</p>
<p>TYPE FIRST PRIORITY SENIOR SECURED DISCOUNT NOTES</p>
<p>COUPON NA</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE 64.949</p>
<p>YIELD 11.125 PCT</p>
<p>MATURITY 5/15/01</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S NA</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B</p>
<p>SPREAD +464.5 BPS</p>
<p>CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE FOR THREE YEARS</p>
<p>PAY FREQ NA</p>
<p>FIRST PAY DATE PAYS AT MATURITY</p>
<p>MT $80 MLN (PROCEEDS)</p>
<p>TYPE SECOND PRIORITY SENIOR SECURED DISCOUNT NOTES</p>
<p>COUPON NA</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE 60.812</p>
<p>YIELD 12.875 PCT</p>
